COMPILATION OF: E46M13

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M13

   1 a 0000 E46M13:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] TWO NUMERIC items in one list, both orders, both
   4 a 0006      routes: FIXED BINARY and FIXED DECIMAL. The console already
   5 a 0006      accepts this pair, so it is here to compare the two routes'
   6 a 0006      numeric chains in one object and to show the widths are per-item
   7 a 0006      (09 for the binary, 06/09/00 for the decimal). */
   8 c 0006   dcl outf file, k fixed bin(15), z fixed dec(6);
   9 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M13OUT DAT');
  10 c 0023   put file(outf) list(k,z);
  11 c 004F   put file(outf) list(z,k);
  12 c 007B   put list(k,z);
  13 c 00A4   put list(z,k);
  14 c 00CD   close file(outf);
  15 a 00D3 end E46M13;

CODE SIZE = 00D6
DATA AREA = 0010
FREE SYMS = 389A
END  COMPILATION
